cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Red-light violation detection: a lightweight computer vision prototype (Cape Coast case study)"
abstract: >-
  Research prototype that analyses recorded traffic video of a signalised
  approach: YOLO11 vehicle detection and ByteTrack tracking, signal-state
  reading from a user-marked region with an explicit uncertain state, a
  stop-line crossing rule that records potential red-light violations for
  human review, a review dashboard, anonymised evidence export and
  evaluation scripts. No number-plate recognition or driver identification.
